<Base title="Videos" current="/en/videos/" lang="en" alt="/videos/">
  <p class="eyebrow">Videos</p>
  <h1>The moving pictures</h1>
  <p class="lede">Four short films found in the archives, re-encoded for the web. The sound is the camera's own.</p>

  <div class="video">
    <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/img/agora-l-evolution-2013-poster.jpg" src="/video/agora-l-evolution-2013.mp4"></video>
    <p><strong>Agora, the evolution</strong> (4 min 21) · January 2013. The slideshow put together at L'AgorA to tell the road travelled in pictures: the land, the tipi, the yurt, the treehouses under construction, the stages at night, the fires, the bunker, and the people who did all of it.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="video">
    <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/img/earthdance-2010-peace-prayer-poster.jpg" src="/video/earthdance-2010-peace-prayer.mp4"></video>
    <p><strong>The prayer for peace, Earthdance 2010</strong> (1 min 03) · September 18, 2010. The moment synchronized around the world, filmed under the spruces of Saint-Fortunat, at the first Earthdance of the Donjon grandeur nature.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="video">
    <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/img/l-ile-avant-la-creation-2010-poster.jpg" src="/video/l-ile-avant-la-creation-2010.mp4"></video>
    <p><strong>The island before the creation</strong> (1 min 10) · July 5, 2010. "The Island b4 the creation": the Cherry Island as it was the first summer, before the cabin, before the kitchen, before the lights.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="video">
    <video controls preload="metadata" poster="/img/hiver-2012-poster.jpg" src="/video/hiver-2012.mp4"></video>
    <p><strong>Winter 2012</strong> (1 min 19) · February 18, 2012. A ride on the four-wheeler along the snowy road of the land, two friends running behind, the mountain in the background.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>And the rest</h2>
    <p>L'AgorA's Facebook page also kept a short clip of the party on the Cherry Island in 2013 ("laughter and tranquility, a small Saturday afternoon"), a 2012 video shot at Earthdance, and "the time the Neverland stage started vibrating full size". They remain on the page, at <a href="https://www.facebook.com/lAg0rA">facebook.com/lAg0rA</a>.</p>
    <p>Before L'AgorA, there was Guindonville. The 2003 film, re-edited in 2019 from the DV tapes that were found again, is on <a href="https://guindonville.pages.dev/film/">guindonville.pages.dev</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
